{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live War</strong> is an easy-to-learn, hard-to-master strategy game\u2014a streamlined take on titles like <i>Company of Heroes</i>, <i>Men of War</i>, and <i>Wargame</i>. As a senior commander, you\u2019ll deploy the right units and abilities at the perfect moment to dominate the battlefield. Watch as your army crushes the enemy, or take matters into your own hands by calling in airstrikes, missiles, or directly commanding officers to turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategy-Driven Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus on tactics</strong>\u2014every decision matters.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clear battlefield intel</strong>\u2014what you see is what you get.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time strategic feedback</strong>\u2014adapt and react instantly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519630/extras/77342595300e7bf4724ebfa65948525c.poster.avif?t=1769703972\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519630/extras/77342595300e7bf4724ebfa65948525c.webm?t=1769703972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519630/extras/77342595300e7bf4724ebfa65948525c.mp4?t=1769703972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Units &amp; Deep Strategies</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of unit types</strong> to deploy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique abilities</strong> like airstrikes, cover setups, and resource buildings.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical counters</strong>\u2014each unit type has strengths and weaknesses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519630/extras/16d07d5eb0574dd1fff0a2a7b5c9c793.poster.avif?t=1769703972\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519630/extras/16d07d5eb0574dd1fff0a2a7b5c9c793.webm?t=1769703972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519630/extras/16d07d5eb0574dd1fff0a2a7b5c9c793.mp4?t=1769703972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Powerful Commanders</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinct personalities &amp; abilities</strong>\u2014offense, defense, air superiority, anti-armor, and more.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Direct control</strong>\u2014commanders are the only unit type you can personally lead.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic buffs</strong>\u2014commanders enhance nearby units, making unit synergy critical.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519630/extras/162dc677df32e2bce01dc040efe2eee0.poster.avif?t=1769703972\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519630/extras/162dc677df32e2bce01dc040efe2eee0.webm?t=1769703972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c